{"n":84,"name":"Al-Inshiqaq","nameAr":"الإنشقاق","meaning":"The Sundering","ayahs":25,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنشَقَّتْ","en":"When the sky has split [open]","w":[{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","tr":"l-samāu","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"ٱنشَقَّتْ","tr":"inshaqqat","en":"is split asunder","root":"شقق","lem":"انشَقَّ"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","en":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]","w":[{"ar":"وَأَذِنَتْ","tr":"wa-adhinat","en":"And has listened","root":"أذن","lem":"أَذِنَ"},{"ar":"لِرَبِّهَا","tr":"lirabbihā","en":"to its Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَحُقَّتْ","tr":"waḥuqqat","en":"and was obligated","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقَّ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا ٱلْأَرْضُ مُدَّتْ","en":"And when the earth has been extended","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","tr":"l-arḍu","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"مُدَّتْ","tr":"muddat","en":"is spread","root":"مدد","lem":"مَدَّ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَلْقَتْ مَا فِيهَا وَتَخَلَّتْ","en":"And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَلْقَتْ","tr":"wa-alqat","en":"And has cast out","root":"لقي","lem":"أَلْقَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"(is) in it"},{"ar":"وَتَخَلَّتْ","tr":"watakhallat","en":"and becomes empty","root":"خلو","lem":"تَخَلَّتْ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","en":"And has listened [i.e., responded] to its Lord and was obligated [to do so] -","w":[{"ar":"وَأَذِنَتْ","tr":"wa-adhinat","en":"And has listened","root":"أذن","lem":"أَذِنَ"},{"ar":"لِرَبِّهَا","tr":"lirabbihā","en":"to its Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَحُقَّتْ","tr":"waḥuqqat","en":"and was obligated","root":"حقق","lem":"حَقَّ"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِنَّكَ كَادِحٌ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَدْحًا فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ","en":"O mankind, indeed you are laboring toward your Lord with [great] exertion and will meet it.","w":[{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","tr":"l-insānu","en":"mankind","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنسان"},{"ar":"إِنَّكَ","tr":"innaka","en":"Indeed, you"},{"ar":"كَادِحٌ","tr":"kādiḥun","en":"(are) laboring","root":"كدح","lem":"كادِح"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"كَدْحًۭا","tr":"kadḥan","en":"(with) exertion","root":"كدح","lem":"كَدْح"},{"ar":"فَمُلَـٰقِيهِ","tr":"famulāqīhi","en":"and you (will) meet Him","root":"لقي","lem":"مُلاقِي"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ","en":"Then as for he who is given his record in his right hand,","w":[{"ar":"فَأَمَّا","tr":"fa-ammā","en":"Then as for"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"(him) who"},{"ar":"أُوتِىَ","tr":"ūtiya","en":"is given","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","tr":"kitābahu","en":"his record","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"بِيَمِينِهِۦ","tr":"biyamīnihi","en":"in his right (hand)","root":"يمن","lem":"يَمِين"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ يُحَاسَبُ حِسَابًا يَسِيرًا","en":"He will be judged with an easy account","w":[{"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","tr":"fasawfa","en":"Then soon"},{"ar":"يُحَاسَبُ","tr":"yuḥāsabu","en":"his account will be taken","root":"حسب","lem":"حاسَبْ"},{"ar":"حِسَابًۭا","tr":"ḥisāban","en":"an account","root":"حسب","lem":"حِساب"},{"ar":"يَسِيرًۭا","tr":"yasīran","en":"easy","root":"يسر","lem":"يَسِير"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"وَيَنقَلِبُ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا","en":"And return to his people in happiness.","w":[{"ar":"وَيَنقَلِبُ","tr":"wayanqalibu","en":"And he will return","root":"قلب","lem":"انقَلَبَ"},{"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"أَهْلِهِۦ","tr":"ahlihi","en":"his people","root":"أهل","lem":"أَهْل"},{"ar":"مَسْرُورًۭا","tr":"masrūran","en":"happily","root":"سرر","lem":"مَسْرُور"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ وَرَآءَ ظَهْرِهِۦ","en":"But as for he who is given his record behind his back,","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"But as for"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"(him) who"},{"ar":"أُوتِىَ","tr":"ūtiya","en":"is given","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","tr":"kitābahu","en":"his record","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"وَرَآءَ","tr":"warāa","en":"behind","root":"وري","lem":"وَراء"},{"ar":"ظَهْرِهِۦ","tr":"ẓahrihi","en":"his back","root":"ظهر","lem":"ظَهْر"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"فَسَوْفَ يَدْعُوا۟ ثُبُورًا","en":"He will cry out for destruction","w":[{"ar":"فَسَوْفَ","tr":"fasawfa","en":"Then soon"},{"ar":"يَدْعُوا۟","tr":"yadʿū","en":"he will call","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"ثُبُورًۭا","tr":"thubūran","en":"(for) destruction","root":"ثبر","lem":"ثُبُور"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"وَيَصْلَىٰ سَعِيرًا","en":"And [enter to] burn in a Blaze.","w":[{"ar":"وَيَصْلَىٰ","tr":"wayaṣlā","en":"And he will burn","root":"صلي","lem":"يَصْلَى"},{"ar":"سَعِيرًا","tr":"saʿīran","en":"(in) a Blaze","root":"سعر","lem":"سَعِير"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فِىٓ أَهْلِهِۦ مَسْرُورًا","en":"Indeed, he had [once] been among his people in happiness;","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, he"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"had been","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"فِىٓ","tr":"fī","en":"among"},{"ar":"أَهْلِهِۦ","tr":"ahlihi","en":"his people","root":"أهل","lem":"أَهْل"},{"ar":"مَسْرُورًا","tr":"masrūran","en":"happy","root":"سرر","lem":"مَسْرُور"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ ظَنَّ أَن لَّن يَحُورَ","en":"Indeed, he had thought he would never return [to Allāh].","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, he"},{"ar":"ظَنَّ","tr":"ẓanna","en":"(had) thought","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّن","tr":"lan","en":"never"},{"ar":"يَحُورَ","tr":"yaḥūra","en":"he would return","root":"حور","lem":"يَحُورَ"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"بَلَىٰٓ إِنَّ رَبَّهُۥ كَانَ بِهِۦ بَصِيرًا","en":"But yes! Indeed, his Lord was ever, of him, Seeing.","w":[{"ar":"بَلَىٰٓ","tr":"balā","en":"Yes"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"رَبَّهُۥ","tr":"rabbahu","en":"his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"was","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ","tr":"bihi","en":"of him"},{"ar":"بَصِيرًۭا","tr":"baṣīran","en":"All-Seer","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصِير"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلشَّفَقِ","en":"So I swear by the twilight glow","w":[{"ar":"فَلَآ","tr":"falā","en":"But nay"},{"ar":"أُقْسِمُ","tr":"uq'simu","en":"I swear","root":"قسم","lem":"أَقْسَمُ"},{"ar":"بِٱلشَّفَقِ","tr":"bil-shafaqi","en":"by the twilight glow","root":"شفق","lem":"شَفَق"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ وَمَا وَسَقَ","en":"And [by] the night and what it envelops","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"wa-al-layli","en":"And the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and what"},{"ar":"وَسَقَ","tr":"wasaqa","en":"it envelops","root":"وسق","lem":"وَسَقَ"}]},{"n":18,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا ٱتَّسَقَ","en":"And [by] the moon when it becomes full","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ","tr":"wal-qamari","en":"And the moon","root":"قمر","lem":"قَمَر"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"ٱتَّسَقَ","tr":"ittasaqa","en":"it becomes full","root":"وسق","lem":"اتَّسَقَ"}]},{"n":19,"juz":30,"ar":"لَتَرْكَبُنَّ طَبَقًا عَن طَبَقٍ","en":"[That] you will surely embark upon [i.e., experience] state after state.","w":[{"ar":"لَتَرْكَبُنَّ","tr":"latarkabunna","en":"You will surely embark","root":"ركب","lem":"رَكِبَ"},{"ar":"طَبَقًا","tr":"ṭabaqan","en":"(to) stage","root":"طبق","lem":"طَبَق"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"طَبَقٍۢ","tr":"ṭabaqin","en":"stage","root":"طبق","lem":"طَبَق"}]},{"n":20,"juz":30,"ar":"فَمَا لَهُمْ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en":"So what is [the matter] with them [that] they do not believe,","w":[{"ar":"فَمَا","tr":"famā","en":"So what"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"(is) for them"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","tr":"yu'minūna","en":"they believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"}]},{"n":21,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِذَا قُرِئَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْقُرْءَانُ لَا يَسْجُدُونَ ۩","en":"And when the Qur’ān is recited to them, they do not prostrate [to Allāh]?","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"قُرِئَ","tr":"quri-a","en":"is recited","root":"قرأ","lem":"قَرَأَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","tr":"ʿalayhimu","en":"to them"},{"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","tr":"l-qur'ānu","en":"the Quran","root":"قرأ","lem":"قُرْءان"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَسْجُدُونَ ۩","tr":"yasjudūna","en":"they prostrate","root":"سجد","lem":"سَجَدَ"}]},{"n":22,"juz":30,"ar":"بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ يُكَذِّبُونَ","en":"But those who have disbelieved deny,","w":[{"ar":"بَلِ","tr":"bali","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"Those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieved","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"يُكَذِّبُونَ","tr":"yukadhibūna","en":"deny","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"}]},{"n":23,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يُوعُونَ","en":"And Allāh is most knowing of what they keep within themselves.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","tr":"aʿlamu","en":"(is) most knowing","root":"علم","lem":"أَعْلَم"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"of what"},{"ar":"يُوعُونَ","tr":"yūʿūna","en":"they keep within themselves","root":"وعي","lem":"أَوْعَى"}]},{"n":24,"juz":30,"ar":"فَبَشِّرْهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en":"So give them tidings of a painful punishment,","w":[{"ar":"فَبَشِّرْهُم","tr":"fabashir'hum","en":"so give them tidings","root":"بشر","lem":"بُشِّرَ"},{"ar":"بِعَذَابٍ","tr":"biʿadhābin","en":"of a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٍ","tr":"alīmin","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":25,"juz":30,"ar":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونٍۭ","en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds. For them is a reward uninterrupted.","w":[{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"Except"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","tr":"waʿamilū","en":"and do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","tr":"l-ṣāliḥāti","en":"righteous deeds","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِحَة"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"For them"},{"ar":"أَجْرٌ","tr":"ajrun","en":"(is) a reward","root":"أجر","lem":"أَجْر"},{"ar":"غَيْرُ","tr":"ghayru","en":"never","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"مَمْنُونٍۭ","tr":"mamnūnin","en":"ending","root":"منن","lem":"مَمْنُون"}]}]}